# Generated per-host skill packs (docs/design/ADR-0008-host-packaging-seam.md §D8.2, §D8.3).
# Built by `node scripts/pack-host.mjs --all`, published as release assets, never committed:
# committing them would add ~5 MB of duplicated skills and rewrite three copies of every file
# in git history on each skill edit. `.claude/skills/` is the only source of truth.
dist/

# NOTHING ELSE BELONGS HERE. In particular, node_modules is deliberately NOT ignored:
# docs/design/ADR-0002-dependency-seam-and-boot-contract.md §D2.2 keeps `git status` as the only
# detector of a stray `npm install` breaking the zero-dependency rule, since the three gates are
# measurably blind to it. Ignoring it would buy tidiness by deleting the detector.
